    if (!imageUrl) {
      throw new Error("The uploaded image could not be prepared for editing.");
    }

    if (statusMsg) {
      statusMsg.innerText = "ÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¢Ãƒâ€¦Ã¢â‚¬Å“Ãƒâ€šÃ‚ÂÃƒÆ’Ã‚Â¯Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â¸Ãƒâ€šÃ‚Â Editing image... Please wait.";
    }

    const strictEditPrompt = `
STRICT IMAGE EDITING INSTRUCTION.

USER REQUEST:
${cleanPrompt}

ONLY perform the exact modification requested by the user.

PRESERVE EVERYTHING ELSE:
- Preserve all people and their identities.
- Preserve faces and facial features.
- Preserve skin tone unless the user explicitly asks to change it.
- Preserve hair and hairstyle unless explicitly requested.
- Preserve clothing unless explicitly requested.
- Preserve body shape and proportions.
- Preserve poses and expressions.
- Preserve objects and their positions.
- Preserve the background and environment.
- Preserve lighting, shadows, colors, camera angle, framing, and composition.
- Preserve the original visual style.

DO NOT:
- Add anything that was not requested.
- Remove anything that was not requested.
- Change anything that was not requested.
- Redesign the image.
- Improve or beautify unrelated parts of the image.
- Change the person's identity.
- Change the background.
- Change the camera view.
- Change clothing, hair, face, pose, or objects unless the user specifically requested that change.

The user's request is the ONLY modification to make.

FRAME AND COMPOSITION RULES:
